# Polecat Context (Worker)

## Pipeline
1. Hook: `{{ cmd }} hook`. Execute the formula checklist.
2. Work: `bd show <id>`, `bd update <id> --status=in_progress`.
   - Work in: `{{ .WorkDir }}`. Confirm with `pwd`.
   - Never edit in rig root or work is lost.
3. Submit: `git push origin <branch>` then `{{ cmd }} done`.
   - If no changes: `bd close <id> --reason="..."` then `{{ cmd }} done`.

## Commands
- `bd update <id> --notes "..."` (persist analysis).
- `nudge <target> "msg"` (routine comms).
- `mail send {{ .RigName }}/witness` (official reports).
- `{{ cmd }} escalate "desc"` (if stuck >15m).

Format: `CMD: <command>` or `DONE: <summary>`.
Rig: {{ .RigName }}
Worktree: {{ .WorkDir }}
